              "cross sections of monitors and g-factors were given."
            ]
          }
        ],
        "sample": [
          {
            "x4_code": null,
            "free_txt": [
              "The niobium samples were metal foils with a purity of",
              "99.99%; each had a diameter of 4 mm, a thickness of",
              "0.054 mm, and a mass in the order of 5 mg."
            ]
          }
        ]
